Z||000008||Hartz||10-25-2001||09:24 AM||||Well, I don't know that it will ever reach a "collector car" status, but I had an Achieva SCX, and it was a wonderful little car.  The 190 HP Quad 4 and 5 speed combination was great.  Used to give my buddy's Probe GT a run for it's money any day of the week.  It got great gas milage, had a decent sized trunk, was well screwed together, and looked nice enough.  I never understood why so many people bagged on these little cars.<P>Hartz<P>'84 SC 5.7L V8<BR>'85 SE 3.1L V6 Turbo<BR>hartzfeld.home.mindspring.com<P>(Edited for typos...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> )<P>[This message has been edited by Hartz (edited 10-25-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Hartz (edited 10-25-2001).]||||reg||14
Z||000009||TRiAD||10-25-2001||10:05 AM||||What's so big about the Beterra GTU?<P>The Beretta GTZ (1990 only) had a <B>190HP</B> quad 4 in it! ...talk about FAST!<P>And the body mods were WAY more tasteful than the GTU. <P>my $.02<P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg"> <BR><I>Photoshop rendering of planned exterior modifications.</I>||||reg||1
Z||000010||Fformula88||10-25-2001||10:18 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Hartz:<BR><B>The 190 HP Quad 4 and 5 speed combination was great.  Used to give my buddy's Probe GT a run for it's money any day of the week.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I hope it really trounced that Probe GT by a couple car lengths at least!  The MAX HP of a PGT was 164, and that came late in its life.  The 89-92 Turbo I-4's were less, although the 164 HP V6 was no =quicker than the turbo four's.<P>I agree the 3800 SC cars could become collectors, but I don't see a lot of the other fwd cars gaining too big of a following.  I don't see many GTO equivalents among GM's fwd cars.  The FWD Impala?  If they do produce the V8 they are talking about then maybe but certainly not as it is now.<P>||||reg||1
